# Build context trimming for the Go server/worker images (context = repo root).
# gen/ is intentionally NOT ignored — it holds the generated proto code the
# build needs. It is NOT committed; the build pipeline runs `make proto` to
# regenerate it into the workspace before `docker build` (see the CI workflows;
# locally run it before `docker compose build`).

.git
.claude
bin/
worker-strava          # stray prebuilt binary at repo root
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# Keep web/ source in context (docker/Dockerfile.core's node stage builds
# it), but drop the heavy/generated dirs. The dev Go images don't COPY web/
# at all (they COPY cmd/internal/gen/api selectively).
web/node_modules
web/build
web/.svelte-kit
web/.env
web/.env.*

# Docs / transcripts / specs aren't needed to build.
transcripts/
docs/
*.md
